---
manual: common.move
lines: [2648, 2653]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: E6
----------- app code
# Moving a line moves all of it: Shoes 3 draws a line across its place box
# (s3t_shape.c:127-132), and move shifts the box.
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 200 do
  stroke red
  strokewidth 3
  @line = line 20, 20, 20, 180
  @line.move(220, 20)
end
----------- test code
box = layout_of(line("@line"))
assert_in_delta 218.5, box.x, 0.01, "the line starts where it was moved"
assert_operator box.w, :<=, 3.01, "and stays upright, its far end moved with it"
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(220, 170).first(3), "drawn low down at x = 220"
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(20, 170).first(3), "and gone from x = 20"
